  "title": "Baked Tortilla Chips",
  "description": "Tortilla chips made at home from corn tortillas are super easy and tastier than store-bought. These have a zingy lime and cumin flavor that pairs well with salsa or hummus.",
  "authors": [
    "Michele O'Sullivan"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-06-19T22:16:00-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-23T11:38:36-04:00",
